<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C, Pass 11 — IridonianReek creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `IridonianReek` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713),
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: `race/body` points at the donor's `Reek` BodyDef — a shared body
  PLAN, not the separate (and unported, absent from the live cast per the
  2026-09-09 sweep) `Reek` species — ported here as `RSW_Reek`
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml), repointing its 3 horn parts to the
  ALREADY-PORTED Wave B `RSW_SW_LeftHorn`/`RSW_SW_RightHorn`/
  `RSW_SW_FrontHorn` and `RSW_SWHornAttackTool` group.

  `leatherDef` repoints to the already-ported `RSW_Leather_Tough`
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml, Pass 3/Borcatu). `specificMeatDef` repoints
  to the already-ported `RSW_Tough_Meat` (RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml) — same
  donor `Tough_Meat` resource, both share the donor's `swresource/Meat_Tough`
  art. No new resource needed this species.

  `canCrossBreedWith` (`Reek`, `IthorianReek`) left pointing at the donor's
  still-bare, still-unported defNames — correct while Mlie stays active and
  neither is in this item's own worklist (Reek dropped from the live cast;
  IthorianReek was never cast-referenced at all). Flagged per the
  FeralGrazer/Pass 7 precedent for whoever next touches either name.

  Sounds repoint to the already-absorbed sound wave: the adult stage uses
  `RSW_Pawn_Reek_*` (NOT `RSW_Pawn_IridonianReek_*` — confirmed against the
  donor's own XML that IridonianReek deliberately reuses plain Reek's sound
  clips, same as the already-documented Sarlacc-ambient/FrilledGorg-reuses-
  Gorg precedent), the baby stage uses `RSW_Pawn_ReekBaby_*`.

  Art: the donor's own PawnKindDef reuses plain Reek's calf and dessicated
  textures (`swanimals/Reek/Reek_j*`, `swanimals/Reek/Reek_Dessicated`) for
  every life stage EXCEPT the adult's living graphic, which uses its own
  `swanimals/IridonianReek/IridonianReek` — extracted verbatim via
  extract_bundle.py against the same live Steam workshop bundle (folder
  3497316713) every prior wave used; texPaths are unchanged text. No
  `*ArtOverride` mod exists for IridonianReek or Reek (checked against the
  full current ~26-mod `*ArtOverride` folder listing before porting, per the
  Dragonsnake/Anooba art-collision trap).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: Desert (0.3), per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row, repointed from the bare "IridonianReek"
  entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml (both the design and
  deployed copies).
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_IridonianReek</defName>
    <label>iridonian reek</label>
    <description>Reek could be found on the planets Iridonia, Kashyyyk, Ithor, Codian Moon, Tatooine and Saleucami (to name just a few). Various subspecies invariably sprung up as the base stock adapted to new environments. The Iridonian Reek was bred as a 'war mount' by the Iridonian Zabraks. Instead of giving them a meat diet, the Iridonian reeks were given a natural diet consisting of plant matter to keep them fierce and strong with natural vigor, which also turned a reek's skin gray. Adapted to Iridonia, their skin could resist sharp and blunt weapon attacks during battle. The Iridonian reek's horns were much sharper and longer than those of other reeks.</description>
